// =========================================================================
//  TEST CASES  —  POST /schools/current/academic-years/{name}/end
// Needs X-School-Subdomain. Run Create School and Create Academic Year first.
//
//  AN EVENT, NOT AN EDIT. Sets isThisYearRunning false and endDate = today, in
//  the SCHOOL's timezone. No body needed; anything sent is ignored.
//
//  THE TRAP: a year that already finished is REFUSED, because writing today
//  would move its end date FORWARD. That is the opposite of ending it.
//
//  A very short year is allowed here and refused by Update Dates, which
//  rejects anything under 30 days as an implausible range.
// =========================================================================
//
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 01  END A RUNNING YEAR                                 -> 200 OK
//     OUT: endDate becomes today, durationDays shrinks.
//     "...it is no longer the year this school is running, and its
//     last day is now Wednesday 9 September 2026, 233 day(s)
//     earlier than planned."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 02  SEND IT AGAIN                                      -> 200 OK
//     IDEMPOTENT. "Nothing changed: '2026-2027' was already closed on
//     Wednesday 9 September 2026 and was not marked as running."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 03  A YEAR THAT ALREADY FINISHED                       -> 409 Conflict
//     Make a year whose endDate is in the past, then end it.
//     OUT: { "code": "ACADEMIC_YEAR_ALREADY_ENDED" }
//     "...already finished on ... Ending it today would move that
//     date forward."
//     THIS IS THE POINT OF THE ENDPOINT'S MAIN GUARD.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 04  A YEAR THAT HAS NOT STARTED                        -> 409 Conflict
//     Make a year starting next month, then end it.
//     OUT: { "code": "ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_STARTED" }
//     "...starts on Friday 9 October 2026, so it cannot be ended today."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 05  A CLOSED DAY AFTER TODAY                           -> 409 Conflict
//     Add a holiday dated next week, then end the year.
//     OUT: { "code": "HOLIDAYS_OUTSIDE_NEW_RANGE" }
//     "1 closed day(s) fall after today and would end up outside the
//     year, starting with ... Remove them first."
//     REFUSED, NOT DELETED. Remove the holiday, then end it.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 06  A CLOSED DAY BEFORE TODAY IS KEPT                  -> 200 OK
//     Add a holiday dated last week, then end the year.
//     It succeeds and holidayCount stays as it was: a closed day already
//     behind us is still inside the shortened year.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 07  A YEAR CUT VERY SHORT                              -> 200 OK
//     Make a year that started 5 days ago. Then:
//     PATCH .../dates {"endDate": "<today>"}  -> 400 IMPLAUSIBLE_DATE_RANGE
//     POST  .../end                          -> 200 OK
//     A school that shut in week one really had a 6-day year.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 08  UNKNOWN YEAR NAME                                  -> 404 Not Found
//     Change {{academicYearName}} to 1999-2000.
//     OUT: { "code": "ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_FOUND" }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 09  NO TENANT HEADER                                   -> 400 Bad Request
//     OUT: { "code": "TENANT_NOT_RESOLVED" }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  REFUSALS
//     400 TENANT_NOT_RESOLVED              No tenant header
//     404 ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_FOUND          Unknown year name
//     404 SCHOOL_NOT_FOUND                 No school has that subdomain.
//     409 ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_STARTED        Today is on or before its first day — it would end before it began.
//     409 ACADEMIC_YEAR_ALREADY_ENDED      It finished in the past, so writing today would move that date FORWARD.
//     409 HOLIDAYS_OUTSIDE_NEW_RANGE       Closed days after today would be stranded outside the shortened year.
//     409 SCHOOL_NOT_EDITABLE              The school is past PROVISIONING or ACTIVE and cannot be edited.

// ===========================================================================
//  RUNNING THE WHOLE COLLECTION? THIS REQUEST GATES EVERY LATER WRITE.
//
//  It sets isThisYearRunning = false, and gate 4 refuses every academic-year
//  and class WRITE on a year that is not running. Academics / Classes runs
//  after Core in folder order, so a top-to-bottom run reaches this first and
//  then answers 409 ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_RUNNING to Create Class, Update Class
//  and Add Section.
//
//  Reads are unaffected - they run no gates - so List Classes, Get Class and
//  List Sections still answer 200 on an ended year.
//
//  Skip this request in a full run, or create a second year for the class
//  requests to use.
// ===========================================================================

