// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 15  SORTING                                             -> 200 OK
//     ?sort=name, ?sort=sequence,desc, ?sort=startDate,desc.
//     ?sort=weightPercent is a 400 — the allowlist is the point.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 16  THE TIEBREAKER                                      -> 200 OK
//     Give two terms the same name, then ?sort=name&size=2 through pages.
//     Every row appears exactly once: the fallback order is appended, and
//     sequence is unique in the year.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
//  EVERY REFUSAL
//     400 INVALID_PAGE                     page is negative.
//     400 INVALID_PAGE_SIZE                size is below 1 or above 100.
//     400 INVALID_SORT_FIELD               A sort field not on the allowlist.
//     400 TENANT_NOT_RESOLVED              The X-School-Subdomain header is missing or blank.
//     404 SCHOOL_NOT_FOUND                 No school has that subdomain.
//     404 ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_FOUND          The {year} is not a year of this school.

