//  it was removed the same day, because twelve documents already store
//  classDocsId and none stores a code.
//
//  THE NAME IS UNIQUE PER YEAR, NOT PER SCHOOL. "Grade 7" in 2026-2027 and
//  "Grade 7" in 2027-2028 are two different classes, and both are allowed.
// =========================================================================
//
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 01  CREATE A CLASS                                     -> 201 Created
//     The body above.
//     OUT: schoolClassId, sectionCount: 0, subjectCount: 0, active: true
//     Header: Location: /schools/current/academic-years/2026-2027/classes/{id}
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 02  DUPLICATE NAME IN THE SAME YEAR                    -> 409 Conflict
//     Send case 01 again.
//     OUT: { "code": "CLASS_NAME_TAKEN",
//     "message": "'2026-2027' already has a class called 'Grade 7'." }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 03  THE SAME NAME IN ANOTHER YEAR                      -> 201 Created
//     Create 2027-2028 first, then send case 01 against it.
//     The name is unique per YEAR, not per school, so this is allowed and is a
//     different document with a different id.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 04  MANY CLASSES IN ONE YEAR                           -> 201 Created, every time
//     Grade 8, Grade 9, Nursery, XII Science.
//     This is the case the old index broke: it indexed a classCode no model
//     declared, so every document indexed a MISSING value and the SECOND class
//     was a duplicate-key error.
//
//     {
//       "name": "Grade 8"
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 05  SECTIONS AND SUBJECTS ARE IGNORED                  -> 201 Created
//     Neither field is on the request, so both are dropped rather than honoured.
//     OUT: sectionCount: 0, subjectCount: 0
//
//     {
//       "name": "Ignored extras",
//       "sections": [{ "sectionNo": "A" }],
//       "subjects": [{ "subjectCode": "MATHEMATICS" }]
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 06  NO NAME                                            -> 400 Bad Request
//     OUT: { "code": "VALIDATION_FAILED", fieldErrors: { name: ... } }
//
//     {
//       "name": "Grade 7"
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 07  AN UNKNOWN YEAR                                    -> 404 Not Found
//     Set the year path parameter to 2099-2100.
//     OUT: { "code": "ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_FOUND" }
//     Gate 4 answers this before the service does — both give the same code.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 08  ANOTHER SCHOOL'S AFFILIATION PROGRAMME             -> 404 Not Found
//     A REAL programme id, belonging to a different school.
//     OUT: { "code": "AFFILIATION_PROGRAMME_NOT_FOUND" }
//     The lookup is findByIdAndSchoolId — the id existing is not enough.
//
//     {
//       "name": "Borrowed programme",
//       "affiliationProgrammeDocsId": "6aa2a107c7cc53f3111217bf"
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 09  A YEAR THAT HAS BEEN ENDED                         -> 409 Conflict
//     Run POST /academic-years/{name}/end first.
//     OUT: { "code": "ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_RUNNING" }
//     Gate 4. Classes cannot be added to a year the school has closed.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  REFUSALS
//     400 VALIDATION_FAILED                No name, a blank name, or one over 120 characters.
//     400 TENANT_NOT_RESOLVED              The X-School-Subdomain header is missing or blank.
//     404 SCHOOL_NOT_FOUND                 No school has that subdomain.
//     404 ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_FOUND          The {year} in the path is not a year of this school.
//     404 AFFILIATION_PROGRAMME_NOT_FOUND  No such programme in this school — including a real id belonging to another school.
//     409 CLASS_NAME_TAKEN                 That year already has a class with that name.
//     409 SCHOOL_NOT_ACTIVE                Gate 1 — the school is suspended, closed or deleted.
//     409 SCHOOL_NOT_READY                 Gate 1 — the school is still PROVISIONING.
//     409 SUBSCRIPTION_NOT_USABLE          Gate 2 — expired, suspended, or the period has ended.
//     404 SUBSCRIPTION_NOT_FOUND           Gate 2 — the school has never had a subscription.
//     409 ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_RUNNING        Gate 4 — the year was ended by POST .../end.

