//  TEST CASES  —  PATCH /schools/current/academic-years/{year}/classes/{id}
// Needs X-School-Subdomain, a year, and a class id from Create Class.
//
//  EVERY FIELD IS OPTIONAL AND ABSENT MEANS "LEAVE IT ALONE". Sending {} is a
//  400 NOTHING_TO_UPDATE rather than a no-op 200, so a client with a broken
//  form finds out.
//
//  A BLANK NAME IS REFUSED, NOT A CLEAR. "name": "" answers
//  400 CLASS_NAME_REQUIRED — the same rule HOLIDAY_NAME_REQUIRED follows in the
//  core module. Silently keeping the old value would hide the client bug.
//
//  THERE IS NO ORDERING FIELD. displayOrder was removed on 2026-09-11. A class
//  has no school-defined position, and #28 lists a year by name.
//
//  NOTHING STRUCTURAL IS HERE. No section, no subject, no active flag. Send
//  them and they are dropped.
// =========================================================================
//
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 01  RENAME IT                                          -> 200 OK
//     The body above.
//     OUT: name: "Grade Seven", and the SAME schoolClassId.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 02  RESEND THE SAME NAME                               -> 200 OK
//     Sending an unchanged name is NOT a conflict with itself — the check
//     compares ids, not names. A cheaper "does this name exist" check would
//     have refused it.
//
//     {
//       "name": "Grade 7 Renamed"
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 03  ATTACH A PROGRAMME                                 -> 200 OK
//     Checked against THIS school. Another school's real id is a 404.
//
//     {
//       "affiliationProgrammeDocsId": "6aa2a107c7cc53f3111217bf"
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 04  DETACH IT                                          -> 200 OK
//     "" clears it; null would leave it alone.
//     OUT: the field drops out of the response.
//
//     {
//       "affiliationProgrammeDocsId": ""
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 05  AN EMPTY BODY                                      -> 400 Bad Request
//     OUT: { "code": "NOTHING_TO_UPDATE" }
//     A PATCH that changes nothing must not report success.
//
//     {
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 06  A BLANK NAME                                       -> 400 Bad Request
//     OUT: { "code": "CLASS_NAME_REQUIRED" }
//     Refused, not treated as a clear.
//
//     {
//       "name": ""
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 07  A NAME ANOTHER CLASS HAS                           -> 409 Conflict
//     Create two classes, then rename one to the other's name.
//     OUT: { "code": "CLASS_NAME_TAKEN" }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 08  A REAL ID UNDER THE WRONG YEAR                     -> 404 Not Found
//     Set year to another year this school has, keeping the same class id.
//     OUT: { "code": "CLASS_NOT_FOUND" } — the year scopes the lookup.
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 09  SECTIONS AND SUBJECTS ARE IGNORED                  -> 200 OK
//     Neither field is on the request.
//     OUT: sectionCount: 0, subjectCount: 0, active still true
//
//     {
//       "name": "Grade Seven",
//       "sections": [{ "sectionNo": "A" }],
//       "active": false
//     }
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  REFUSALS
//     400 NOTHING_TO_UPDATE                The body sends none of the three fields.
//     400 CLASS_NAME_REQUIRED              "name": "" — a name cannot be removed, only replaced.
//     400 VALIDATION_FAILED                A name over 120 characters.
//     400 TENANT_NOT_RESOLVED              The X-School-Subdomain header is missing or blank.
//     404 SCHOOL_NOT_FOUND                 No school has that subdomain.
//     404 ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_FOUND          The {year} in the path is not a year of this school.
//     404 CLASS_NOT_FOUND                  No class with that id in that year — including a real id under the wrong year, or another school's.
//     404 AFFILIATION_PROGRAMME_NOT_FOUND  No such programme in this school, including another school's real id.
//     409 CLASS_NAME_TAKEN                 Another class in that year already has that name.
//     409 SCHOOL_NOT_ACTIVE                Gate 1 — the school is suspended, closed or deleted.
//     409 SUBSCRIPTION_NOT_USABLE          Gate 2 — expired, suspended, or the period has ended.
//     409 ACADEMIC_YEAR_NOT_RUNNING        Gate 4 — the year was ended by POST .../end.

