//  THE ROW IS THIN, AND THAT IS THE SECURITY DECISION. Name, number, gender,
//  phone, email — no date of birth, no address, no emergency contact. Those
//  are #8. A list is read by every dropdown; this module has no authorization.
//
//  THE SORT ALLOWLIST IS PART OF THAT. A pass-through would order by fields
//  the row withholds, which leaks them. ?sort=dateOfBirth is a 400.
